 advanced biomaterials and connected medical devices."},{"type":"p","text":"A future-ready Biomedical Engineer should combine engineering fundamentals with clinical understanding, regulatory knowledge, data/AI skills and product-development discipline."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest engineers will be able to communicate effectively with doctors, researchers, patients, regulatory specialists, software engineers and manufacturing teams."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / research pathways"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation","Relevant exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"AIIMS","url":"https://www.aiims.edu/"},{"text":"Clinical environment and medical technologies"}],[{"text":"CSIR","url":"https://www.csir.res.in/"},{"text":"Biomedical/materials research"}],[{"text":"DRDO","url":"https://www.drdo.gov.in/"},{"text":"Biomedical and rehabilitation technologies"}],[{"text":"BARC","url":"https://www.barc.gov.in/"},{"text":"Medical instrumentation and advanced technologies"}],[{"text":"ICMR","url":"https://www.icmr.gov.in/"},{"text":"Biomedical/health research"}],[{"text":"Department of Biotechnology","url":"https://dbtindia.gov.in/"},{"text":"Biotechnology and biomedical research"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Private employers to monitor"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Medtronic","url":"https://www.medtronic.com/"},{"text":"GE HealthCare","url":"https://www.gehealthcare.com/"},{"text":"Siemens Healthineers","url":"https://www.siemens-healthineers.com/"},{"text":"Philips","url":"https://www.philips.com/"},{"text":"Johnson & Johnson MedTech","url":"https://www.jnj.com/healthcare-products-and-innovations"},{"text":"Boston Scientific","url":"https://www.bostonscientific.com/"},{"text":"Stryker","url":"https://www.stryker.com/"},{"text":"Abbott","url":"https://www.abbott.com/"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Look for exposure to R&D, medical-device manufacturing, clinical engineering, equipment service, quality, regulatory affair